There is a way I know of. If the minetown altar is *NOT* co-aligned,
then you can convert it. This will annoy the priest, obviously. And you
can then kill him. However, a temple priest is high enough to mollify a
chaotic god, if he leaves a corpse.

Just as a side note - if the temple is coaligned, the aligned priests's
corpse is still fine to sacrifice to appease your god... it'll just
mean you lose all protection when you piss him off and try to kill him.



